  "section": "<section class=\"case-studies wrap\" id=\"case-studies\" aria-labelledby=\"case-studies-title\"><h2 id=\"case-studies-title\">Case studies</h2><article aria-labelledby=\"analucia-case-title\"><div class=\"case-study-feature\"><div><h3 id=\"analucia-case-title\">A personal diamond expert for Analucia.</h3><p>AI Catalyst brought together specialist partners to put Sofia, an AI jewellery expert, inside Analucia\u2019s online shopping experience.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"online-conversion.html\">Explore agentic consumer intelligence <span class=\"arrow-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path d=\"M4 16 16 4M7 4h9v9\"></path></svg></span></a></div><figure class=\"service-film\"><a class=\"service-film__play\" href=\"https://youtu.be/q0T5rtU1VG8\" data-youtube-id=\"q0T5rtU1VG8\" data-video-title=\"AI Catalyst - Analucia digital concierge launch\" aria-label=\"Play the Analucia case study\"><img src=\"assets/case-studies/analucia-sofia.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Sofia\u2019s jewellery guidance interface in the Analucia shopping experience\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><span class=\"service-film__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 3 22 12 7 21Z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"service-film__duration\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1:46</span></a></figure></div><div class=\"case-study-details\"><div><h4>The challenge</h4><p>Bring expert product guidance into online jewellery shopping, where customers need help comparing pieces and choosing what suits them.</p></div><div><h4>What shipped</h4><p>A digital host integrated into the shopping experience, giving customers a way to ask product questions while exploring the jewellery.</p></div><div><h4>What shoppers can do</h4><p>Ask about pieces, explore matching jewellery and get guidance towards a purchase. The film shows the experience in action.</p></div></div></article></section>"